{
  "label": "AI writers recognised on rules",
  "category": "Rules",
  "description": "AI assistants / models recognised in a rule's author and in the author / written_with / generated_by fields of its text, shown as a badge on the rule page. pattern = what names it (regex, case-insensitive), model = what captures the model name (regex), logo = an image URL (Simple Icons) or null for initials, color = the badge colour.",
